# Luau Programming Language

> Luau is a small, fast, and embeddable programming language derived from Lua with a gradual type system.

Luau (lowercase u, /ˈlu.aʊ/) is a programming language derived from Lua 5.1, designed for performance, safety, and embeddability. It features a state-of-the-art gradual type system, a fast interpreter with an optional JIT compiler, and is used as the scripting language for the Roblox platform.

